## Relationship to PumpStation

Companion stacked PumpStation PR #15 pins the current Kernel source and implements a deny-all proposal adapter. This Kernel PR does not validate or approve that source. The final PumpStation manifest hash must be bound only after review.

## Evidence boundary

This PR does not:

- register a service identity;
- issue a grant;
- create legal authority;
- approve a Venture Cell charter;
- enable transport;
- enable money movement, trading, custody, promotion, or external effects.

Do not merge automatically.
